    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Estimate ciliary force vectors from beat orientation and frequency, predict net thrust for each bot, and test whether symmetric morphotype-1 bots have near-zero vector sums and only residual wiggling.";
