    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Cilia distribution images do not provide force direction and magnitude.", "Shape, adhesion, and orientation offer rival explanations for nonmovement.";
